{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "5986164920ff2191a42a49e7e179baa5acc8d838e92e296ca920f6e0af21dc6d", "ja": "杏奈の応援", "zh": "杏奈的加油", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6ebcf4bcc2ed116714bf9d8b3115219660075bfd01742ff1cdb3a14f4f158306", "ja": "メールの女の子を心配し続ける杏奈を元気づ\nけようと、可奈は全力でチアする。メンバー\nやプロデューサーと話した杏奈は、結果が気\nになるのではなく、ただ頑張った女の子を労\nってあげたかったんだ、と気づくのだった。", "zh": "为了让一直担心邮件中那个女孩的杏奈打起精神， 可奈全力为她加油。成员\n和制作人交谈后，杏奈意识到，自己在意的并不是结果，\n只是想好好慰劳那个努力过的女孩。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "81776d5dbd48463c4ff5a5cca086fb909755595d56f5cd42708c0ca05cd1cd26", "ja": "（精力的なチアライブのおかげで、中央エリアでの\nアイドル達の認知度は、かなり向上した！　ただ……）", "zh": "（多亏了活力十足的应援演唱会，偶像们在中央区域的知名度大幅提升了！不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "83ed1175251ceb0d05bf2d01b740fbd6db9ffa2083cbd4906a8cbda954321e48", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\n杏奈、もう着替えたから……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……。\n杏奈已经换好衣服了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1002_024ann", "source_sha256": "967f98835dec45f946df06b3fcf7fa13820bdbc35858d97acfa1412eba48bc2c", "ja": "まだ、ここにいて……いい……？\nえっと、新幹線……来る、時間まで……。", "zh": "我还可以……待在这里吗……？\n那个，直到新干线……到来的时间……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a92a3e29298c8cc4f13b400363439811881beabff145bec31385067162b76a84", "ja": "ああ、もちろん。俺も付き合うよ。みんなに\n声をかけてくるから、ここで待っててくれるか？", "zh": "当然，没问题。我也陪你。我要去跟大家说一声，你在这里等我，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "8fd5041ea479dbed6432792bb9073ff1d64931a9b664bc69270c823c806a19ab", "ja": "ん……ありがと、です……。", "zh": "嗯……谢谢你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1005_p", "source_sha256": "82ea2d7187b9ceb74f89d122760d7dc4455e7e52a50686412bd0ab195fbd320b", "ja": "（杏奈は今日も、あの子の姿を探してしまっている。\n意味がないと、わかってはいるんだろうけど……）", "zh": "（杏奈今天也还是忍不住寻找那个孩子的身影。她应该也明白这样没有意义吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1006_p", "source_sha256": "77adec974e3c701e93a237b553cfbf5740b254e0c1ba8783cb265094dc7d0e8c", "ja": "無理にやめさせた所で、解決にはならないしな……。\n結局、あの子に聞くしか……とはいえ……。", "zh": "就算强行让她停下来，也解决不了问题……\n说到底，还是只能去问那孩子……话虽如此……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "95efed3ae3805f5c21b7c76271938126c212a6c0a8b182b9ac0bd13562401c74", "ja": "あっ、いたいた！\n{$P$}さ～ん！", "zh": "啊！原来你在这里！\n{$P$}先生～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1008_p", "source_sha256": "481d431cdc576b680dede40382effd23276545ce53e8ec9266a7e1c85172e0c1", "ja": "可奈……って、まだ着替えてないのか？\nそろそろ準備しないと、帰りの新幹線に遅れるぞ。", "zh": "可奈……等等，你还没换衣服吗？\n再不准备的话，可要赶不上回去的新干线了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "5e0427d940a8f05916d22702a3f066f523a023185fa87f21fbd3111f3300e5d4", "ja": "はい、そのことなんですけど……\nひとつ、私のお願いを聞いてください！", "zh": "嗯，正是关于那件事……\n请听我一个请求！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "39870accb4304707831b9c03f80812170226f965dc0bed14759afd9bf29eed5f", "ja": "杏奈ちゃ～ん！！\n注目、ちゅうも～く！！", "zh": "杏奈——！！\n注意，注意——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "3c69c640c33a387d6a03146b77a03d8d63dcee7da656aec678f2da971614d76b", "ja": "可奈……？　その恰好……どうした、の？\nもう、着替えないと……。", "zh": "可奈……？你这身打扮……怎么了？\n已经……得换衣服了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "98d414d40a8322db05997c19935d293b72565eb2a1c0f6e5f1ffcf54627128cf", "ja": "杏奈ちゃん……私の想い、聞いてください！\n……すぅ。", "zh": "杏奈……请听听我的心意！\n……吸气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "caee2ef5b9ae011c6c1893695bfa729a442e52d62747bcb9e196498f3a717123", "ja": "フレフレ～♪　杏奈ちゃ～ん♪\nいつでもどこでも、応援してるよ〜♪", "zh": "加油加油～♪杏奈亲～♪\n无论何时何地，我都会为你加油哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "7cafc4dfdce2f87b787dff051e8b5698222a7f7d550cdc67823bb3287ed32060", "ja": "杏奈ちゃんの応援は、とびっきり～♪\nだってもらったら、勇気百倍～♪", "zh": "杏奈的加油，特别特别棒～♪\n因为收到了的话，就会勇气百倍～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1016_024ann", "source_sha256": "9e4704ea65337c3997f0a63b8c0b1591e1e8e32dd91eae7de9759c4933e04177", "ja": "可奈……。", "zh": "可奈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "b1347bdbd6bb794c2de952f06b37c51796076684b9ea331e80d0bbd1cd96cca4", "ja": "杏奈ちゃんの笑顔のためなら～♪\nいっぱい励ますよ～♪　歌も～歌いますよ～♪", "zh": "为了杏奈的笑容～♪\n我会好好鼓励她～♪　也会唱歌给她听哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1018_024ann", "source_sha256": "c1a347ce5837d45ca991a06fed3976e274bb1b448c85c6d51922d3c630e2bc64", "ja": "……ふふっ。\n最後のだけ……ちょっと、変……。", "zh": "……呵呵。\n就最后那句……有点、奇怪……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "532329f17d762620ae04f7b32bbf8b433175336b6b39434ca85890ed7c0d37fd", "ja": "えへへ……杏奈ちゃん、元気出た？　最近ずっと、\n落ち込んじゃってるみたいだったから……。", "zh": "诶嘿嘿……杏奈，你打起精神了吗？因为你最近好像一直都很消沉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1020_024ann", "source_sha256": "17473332c3f1dbedee64216917c7283d6202338c4aed16e14f4a335e63f73d84", "ja": "うん……ありがとう、可奈。\n元気、出た……。", "zh": "嗯……谢谢你，可奈。\n我已经打起精神了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1021_036kan", "source_sha256": "d2dc5215f889faf52359a9333b04023d16919c9cb755d837c0b26812d18a7481", "ja": "よかった～！\nあのね、杏奈ちゃんはちゃんと応援できてるよ！", "zh": "太好了～！\n我跟你说哦，杏奈其实一直在好好为大家加油打气呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1022_036kan", "source_sha256": "d83fee35bacf57fc1d56942866490b89549b4cab8ffa73d659ad53c067e76179", "ja": "だって私、いっつも杏奈ちゃんに励まされてるもん！\n杏奈ちゃんから、すっごく元気もらってるし♪", "zh": "因为我一直都受到杏奈鼓励嘛！而且还从杏奈那里获得了好多活力呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1023_024ann", "source_sha256": "d60bfa15de2503b2911f1c7aa5f193f724debc2d1fa17191866eb564d640b8f4", "ja": "そう、なの……？\n杏奈が、可奈のこと……？", "zh": "是、这样吗……？\n杏奈她……对可奈……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1024_036kan", "source_sha256": "6f16b5b335f9e0fa4903ec2e89156c0fd9ba7c885463c6b8685504284f89db30", "ja": "うん！　だから、杏奈ちゃんの応援じゃダメだなんて、\n言わないでほしいなって！", "zh": "嗯！所以，请不要说给杏奈加油不行什么的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1025_024ann", "source_sha256": "9e4704ea65337c3997f0a63b8c0b1591e1e8e32dd91eae7de9759c4933e04177", "ja": "可奈……。", "zh": "可奈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1026_001har", "source_sha256": "efc9567dcd51f484152aa1979d940a61a489dc97ff4c97acc80fd97538d55b0f", "ja": "可奈ちゃんだけじゃないよ～♪\n私もたくさん元気、もらってるよ～♪", "zh": "不只是可奈哦～♪\n我也从你那里获得了满满的活力哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1027_050jul", "source_sha256": "d42ee41cf24840a964cae9f82197939baece06776edd6f2287fa06f761b33bac", "ja": "信じろアンナ～♪　お前の応援には絶大なパワ～♪\nははっ、こんな感じか……？", "zh": "相信吧，安娜～♪ 你的加油有着无比强大的力量～♪\n哈哈，大概是这种感觉吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1028_036kan", "source_sha256": "c6ff8b29d0690671e1023f7b405e6378313144146c4b63fb114b5c0ed977d25b", "ja": "はれっ！？　みんなまで！！", "zh": "咦！？连大家也要来！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1029_p", "source_sha256": "c7c7eb918f0d8609269a9e6117f141d072cbe154540ba9e01078b33c96069fe2", "ja": "ふたりも、「自分達も杏奈を励ましたい」って\n言い出してな……飛び入り参加ってわけだ。", "zh": "两个人也说“我们也想给杏奈打气”，所以就临时加入了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1030_001har", "source_sha256": "23ec2c2a75d52f31821989bedb632bfc357f6af06702398e726bc1f54edf7b91", "ja": "杏奈ちゃんに元気を出してほしいのは、\n私も同じ気持ちだからね！", "zh": "因为我也和你们一样，希望杏奈能打起精神来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1031_050jul", "source_sha256": "8ab2157a5101a6b161b66d04f2a14f6289fe18ccfb0bc741e9edd8a9b394f1d7", "ja": "もちろん、あたしもな。せっかくだから、\nギターも持ってくりゃよかったかな？", "zh": "我也一样。难得来一次，\n早知道把吉他也带过来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1032_024ann", "source_sha256": "313496c5a4cef0be9344dda95ce302a80c5e6307ab68524c87fbe6770cf46a4a", "ja": "みんな……。\n{$P$}さんも……。", "zh": "大家……。\n{$P$}先生也是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1033_024ann", "source_sha256": "a160dab3eafb1c0a7cf69e284aefaa98885a4e37a0daaa9fa979e8d0ab9df554", "ja": "心配かけて……ごめん、なさい……。杏奈……\nメールの子のこと、気にしちゃって……。", "zh": "让大家担心了……对、不起……杏奈……\n不由得……在意起发邮件给我的那个孩子了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1034_p", "source_sha256": "f5226a6e1fe40a0f6f2299cf91c39e4e515e97dcfc6349aba66908fce061185f", "ja": "よくメールをくれていた子だし。\n杏奈が気にするのは仕方がないよ。", "zh": "毕竟是经常发邮件给你的孩子。\n杏奈会挂念也是很正常的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1035_p", "source_sha256": "3f6019887234a1115f9ea261730d582a2b7dae3b84f00c1ec386543796b44ed9", "ja": "でも、連絡がないだけで、結果はわからないから。\nそれに報告するのもしないのも、相手の自由だし……。", "zh": "不过，只是没有联系而已，还不知道结果呢。\n而且，要不要汇报也是对方的自由……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1036_024ann", "source_sha256": "210e494162623bfa03f5f5c8255a2d7d77e4c7a299e163cc11db35bb43557cb6", "ja": "……うん。杏奈も……そう思う……。", "zh": "……嗯。杏奈也……这么觉得……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1037_p", "source_sha256": "a8845f4e68ce3c4e2cc622b78ea9afed9772e7341079f66bc91567808498cd81", "ja": "だったら、杏奈にできる事は、応援じゃないか？\nたとえあの子の勝負が、終わった後だったとしてもな！", "zh": "既然这样，杏奈能做的，不就是为她加油吗？就算那孩子的比赛已经结束了也一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1038_024ann", "source_sha256": "119aa7cd48a0aadb9469a8e4ebfaf5361949a847f0fac4a1900711dcffdb3fe4", "ja": "勝負が、終わった後……でも……？", "zh": "比赛结束后……也可以……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1039_p", "source_sha256": "62016df6209d1dd3fba40f6f95b2593a33273362241a346c14ac3940da15fe6d", "ja": "ああ。だって杏奈は、あの子の事を\nずっと気にかけていたじゃないか。", "zh": "对。因为杏奈不是一直都很在意那孩子吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1040_p", "source_sha256": "bc7b39132d62b19654e6c8a453e5afae86f8cca9146790ee70b5ebdd7d9ba26c", "ja": "どんな結果だったとしても……やりきって\n勝負を終えた人を、励ます事はできるよな？", "zh": "不管结果如何……总能鼓励那个拼尽全力结束比赛的人吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1041_024ann", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1042_024ann", "source_sha256": "b6fc66b746b829d9433f83fb4ad14d9683798bc5bf845aaa00f807290d9c12f3", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\n杏奈、わかった、かも……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n\n杏奈好像明白了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1043_p", "source_sha256": "01dfbf0b9b426403d7e3c47d2de07ddc85c0a0a0b965e56d5cc1b02ef261ac69", "ja": "うん。", "zh": "嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1044_024ann", "source_sha256": "400aaee669187b34bc2e12fd35203b79c6c5896ef15492bb153fd33f5c115cab", "ja": "杏奈……成功でも、失敗でも……。\n頑張ったねって、言ってあげたい……。", "zh": "杏奈……不管成功还是失败……都想对她说一句“你努力过了”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1045_024ann", "source_sha256": "e8f764ab9c7bbb0670dc4676743c635361476f838685386e056ecf8031ff2871", "ja": "勇気を出したんだね……すごく、すごくえらいね、\nって……あの子に、言ってあげたい……です……！", "zh": "你鼓起勇气了呢……真的、真的很棒，\n我想这样……对那孩子说……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1046_001har", "source_sha256": "d56b392013b504901b88377a7cb25ac651947b4d4ffe37e0698e766b6e9fc6c8", "ja": "うん……そうだよね！\nたくさん頑張った人にも、パワーは必要だもんね！", "zh": "嗯……是啊！\n对努力了那么久的人来说，力量也是必不可少的嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1047_050jul", "source_sha256": "676dbc8261f3aa7aa32031adbcf070ed0147564297a96d4db6e9ba53e68a43d4", "ja": "そうだな。きっとあの子も、\nどこかでアンナの応援を聞いてると思う。", "zh": "是啊。我想，那孩子一定也在某个地方听着杏奈的加油。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1048_024ann", "source_sha256": "ba30e6fea8856ce973a963bd82a1793c9fcdbc0aac122800334078845f523f86", "ja": "うん……！\n杏奈の応援、届けたい、です……！", "zh": "嗯……！我想把杏奈的鼓励传达给她……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1049_036kan", "source_sha256": "c2d48cd250b273b3207eaa6e74f6be583b6e457144e7a001e18c81148e735141", "ja": "杏奈ちゃん……！　よかったぁ……\n元気になってくれて、本当によかったよ～！", "zh": "杏奈……！太好了……\n你能恢复精神，真的太好了呀～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1050_024ann", "source_sha256": "077aa9b2af135d9c75140ed7436397aa8b644e9560626d0a3da7291f74c38ad5", "ja": "可奈、ありがと……。\n可奈の応援……うれしかった、よ……。", "zh": "可奈，谢谢你……。\n可奈的加油……我很开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1051_036kan", "source_sha256": "5082b6da7f6db759a210e74be1a683f0830f62f3004eee9836c12ad4858289f8", "ja": "どういたしまして！　杏奈ちゃんのためなら\nいくらでも～♪　お届けしちゃうよ応援～♪　えへっ！", "zh": "不客气！只要是为了杏奈，多少都可以～♪ 我会把加油送给你哦～♪ 嘿嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_05_1052_024ann", "source_sha256": "9aaa89efa9ebc7ffe3f9478ba5e05d441a336e34aff7167264f4e98f08a6fe8d", "ja": "ありがとう……可奈、みんな……♪", "zh": "谢谢……可奈，还有大家……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
